	quest.000000000000009D.quest_desc: [
		"Passive skill tree mod is a simple skill mod to progress in your adventure "
		""
		"To get started, gather some experience to acquire your first skill point."
		""
		"Then press O (default key, if it doesn't work - check your key bindings)."
		""
		"Then select your class but choose carefully, you cannot change it."
		""
		"You can path to other classes later if you think it is worth it."
		""
		"Maximum skill points are &465&r, so plan your tree carefully."
		""
		"NEW MECHANICS"
		""
		"GEMS"
		""
		"You can find gems in any ore."
		""
		"Can be inserted into equipment on a smithing table."
		""
		"To remove gems from equipment, you need to insert vacucite gem into it. It will consume all the gems."
		""
		"Vacucite have a smaller drop chance."
		""
		"Each gem provides different attribute bonuses, based on the type of equipment it is in."
		""
		"LIFE REGENERATION"
		""
		"New attribute."
		""
		"If you have life regeneration, you will be slowly healed over time."
		""
		"Life regeneration also consume small amount of hunger points."
		""
		"It will not work if you have 0 hunger points."
		""
		"EVASION CHANCE"
		""
		"New attribute."
		""
		"Gives a chance to completely evade enemy attack."
		""
		"BLOCK CHANCE"
		""
		"New attribute."
		""
		"Gives a chance to automatically block enemy attack."
		""
		"Requires a shield."
		""
		" LIFE ON BLOCK"
		""
		"New attribute."
		""
		"When you block an attack, you will be healed."
		""
		"It doesn't have to be an automatic block."
		""
		" LIFE PER HIT"
		""
		"New attribute."
		""
		"When you attack an enemy, you will be stronger !"
		""
		"Have a great one !!!"
	]
	quest.000000000000009D.quest_subtitle: "(brief explanation about stats)"
	quest.000000000000009D.title: "&ePassive Skill Tree Mod"
