	quest.19B32C52F6F2C275.quest_desc: ["The Thornlands stage is the final functioning stage in Twilight Forest. It is completed by simply burning through the dense bushes of Thorns with a Lamp of Cinders. This allows the player to move onto the final stage of progression."]
