	quest.1BB3D2363217DC1F.title: "Draekhalde Den !"
	quest.1BD995C354FC9DC1.quest_subtitle: "To obtain the power of this bar you'll have to wait until a storm happen, then you will place raw gold block topped with an ancient debris topped with a raw iron block. To active the final step, the player have to jump on the raw iron block. (an image is on the oam mod page !)"
	quest.1BF005BE6277D1CC.quest_desc: [
		"Tools are divided into 7 basic categories, which can be view in the main menu of the &nHolosphere&r"
		""
		"Each module either consumes or provides the Integrity, a basic resource that determines a cost of a module and a tool's capacity to install modules. For more info, see Modules."
		""
		"To craft modules you will require tools of certain tiers (in your inventory, on a Rack or in a form of a Forge Hammer). Basic, and first, tool that you will probably have to use is a hammer of certain tier. Other things, like handle wraps, would require you to have something called \"cutting implement tier II\", which is basically a sword modified to have a short blade module. You can learn which tools provide which capabilities by investigating the &e&nHolosphere.&r&r's screen with tool heads. In it's interface you can inspect each individual tool and check material properties, including it's durability modifier, efficiency modifier, tier it provides when used for a tool's major module, tier of a tool it requires to be crafted with and others (see Materials). You can filter by various properties the module's details screen of &e&nHolosphere.&r&r"
	]
	quest.1BF005BE6277D1CC.quest_subtitle: "Everything about the Holoshere"
